<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at the $926,000 German Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat 11-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) 1-0 after Schultz-McCarthy withdrew Sandrine Testud (France) beat 3-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(11-9) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>12-Mary Pierce (France) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-3 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) beat 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-4 4-2 (Habsudova withdrew injured)</p>
<p>14-Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7) 6-1</p>
<p>6-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ines Gorrochategui (Argentinia) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>2-Jana Novtona (Czech Republic) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany)</p>
<p>6-4 2-6 7-5</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 15-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>4-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 6-3 5-7 6-3 Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Eva Martincova (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
